      "cooked": "<p>Christopher is coming to Indianapolis in April for lots of gaming events at various stores, in support of Shattered Timelines' release.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The following schedule is tentative (but almost certainly correct)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>4/17 &nbsp; &nbsp;Wed &nbsp; 5-9pm &nbsp; &nbsp; GP Bloomington</li>\n<li>4/18 &nbsp; &nbsp;Thu &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;5-9pm &nbsp; &nbsp; Arsenal</span>\n</li>\n<li><span>4/19 &nbsp; &nbsp;Fri &nbsp; &nbsp; 1-5pm &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;IUPUI Gamers Guild</span></li>\n<li><span>4/19 &nbsp; &nbsp;Fri &nbsp; &nbsp; 7-10pm &nbsp; &nbsp;Gamerz</span></li>\n<li><span>4/20 &nbsp; &nbsp;Sat &nbsp; &nbsp;12-4pm &nbsp; &nbsp;GP W. Lafayette</span></li>\n<li><span>4/20 &nbsp; &nbsp;Sat &nbsp; &nbsp; 6-9pm &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;GP Greenwood</span></li>\n<li>4/21 &nbsp; &nbsp;Sun &nbsp; &nbsp;1-5pm &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;GP Fashion Mall Commons</li>\n<li><span>4/22 &nbsp; &nbsp;Mon &nbsp; 5-8pm &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Comic Carnival</span></li>\n</ul><div>&nbsp;</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
